	(text "Buttons can be whatever, but I used tall ones found here:\n\nhttps://www.digikey.ca/en/products/detail/e-switch/tl3301pf160qg/1756542\n\n\n\nAlso, for resistor it may be worth using an array. I designed this before I knew what R-arr's looked like. \nHere's a link to one I found that's 10k and has 8 resistors:\n\nhttps://www.digikey.ca/en/products/detail/panasonic-industry/EXB-2HV103JV/285331\n\n\n\nAdditionally, instead of having FLOOR1, FLOOR2, ..., it might be worth using a \nMUX here to make 8 inputs into 3 outputs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 173.228 139.954 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7fc4bdc3-2498-4268-abd3-59daa73357ef")
	)
